{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_54BEDEFD","title":"Mica A Blaze of Neon Glory","entry":"Dlg_54BEDEFD::entry","exit":"Dlg_54BEDEFD::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B11F64EA","articyId":"72057619807803875","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"What? You look like you're hiding something.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What? You look like you're hiding something.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-875.0,"y":-350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"46563","byteOffset":31947656,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_2644C6BD","articyId":"72057619807805647","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"Yes I thought you might.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes I thought you might.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1225.0,"y":-475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35737","byteOffset":27868384,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_F45B4FC5","articyId":"72057619807805741","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"After a thorough investigation of your business, your transactions and delivery records, as well as a conveniently placed tip about a specific item you have on your person...","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"After a thorough investigation of your business, your transactions and delivery records, as well as a conveniently placed tip about a specific item you have on your person...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":25.0,"y":-350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50260","byteOffset":33355712,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_1861967D","articyId":"72057619807805781","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"It's what I KNOW you have. I can SMELL it on you. Evidence. Proof of your wrongdoing.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's what I KNOW you have. I can SMELL it on you. Evidence. Proof of your wrongdoing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17762","byteOffset":14607712,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_BD69B8B3","articyId":"72057619807805788","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"I don't know whether or not to be impressed by your moxie. Even in the face of an inevitable end, you're still trying to figure out how you lost. Unfortunately, it won't do you any good. Unless you want to point me in another direction... With sufficient evidence of course.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't know whether or not to be impressed by your moxie. Even in the face of an inevitable end, you're still trying to figure out how you lost. Unfortunately, it won't do you any good. Unless you want to point me in another direction... With sufficient evidence of course.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":-425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50465","byteOffset":33433992,"byteLength":584}},{"id":"DFr_45C2D033","articyId":"72057821671352215","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"I'll do what I can, AFTER you give me what I want.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'll do what I can, AFTER you give me what I want.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1825.0,"y":-450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39024","byteOffset":29094952,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_B945F564","articyId":"72057821671352229","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"Freya's arrest is the first step to bringing down Conland Containers, then the whole Network. Once The Network is dismantled, everyone will be back in their rightful place and we'll all go back to normal.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Freya's arrest is the first step to bringing down Conland Containers, then the whole Network. Once The Network is dismantled, everyone will be back in their rightful place and we'll all go back to normal.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2425.0,"y":-450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47588","byteOffset":32340912,"byteLength":584}},{"id":"DFr_D74BB12F","articyId":"72057821671352243","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"And I HAVE her! After all this time, I finally have her! My time has come.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And I HAVE her! After all this time, I finally have her! My time has come.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3025.0,"y":-425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19124","byteOffset":15120720,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_58DFA680","articyId":"72057834556102326","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"We have business. Let's get it over with. Your time is up. I need you to do something... I need you to admit YOU LOSE.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We have business. Let's get it over with. Your time is up. I need you to do something... I need you to admit YOU LOSE.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-275.0,"y":-350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18034","byteOffset":14709920,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_888A97E4","articyId":"72057834556102385","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"Not so fast. Before I agree to let you go, for now, I need you to say it. Say the words. I want you to say \"I LOSE.\"","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not so fast. Before I agree to let you go, for now, I need you to say it. Say the words. I want you to say \"I LOSE.\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3625.0,"y":-425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47084","byteOffset":32145160,"byteLength":532}},{"id":"DFr_E8C2AE80","articyId":"72057834556102421","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"A fool to the end. So prideful. It will cost you. When I'm done with Freya, I'll be back to finish you.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A fool to the end. So prideful. It will cost you. When I'm done with Freya, I'll be back to finish you.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20967","byteOffset":15814520,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_56CA600F","articyId":"72057834556102430","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Mica Rain","text":"Good doggy.","speakerId":"Ntt_82133E14","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Good doggy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4225.0,"y":-550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33805","byteOffset":20671184,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_BB32A1E5","articyId":"72057619807805597","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No...","TextSheVersion":"No...","TextTheyVersion":"No..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":-575.0,"y":-475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25412","byteOffset":17498776,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_929DF4CF","articyId":"72057619807805631","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I have an offer.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I have an offer.","TextSheVersion":"I have an offer.","TextTheyVersion":"I have an offer."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":925.0,"y":-475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51290","byteOffset":33818312,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_EC0FB543","articyId":"72057619807805654","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I can give you what you want, but I need something in return.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I can give you what you want, but I need something in return.","TextSheVersion":"I can give you what you want, but I need something in return.","TextTheyVersion":"I can give you what you want, but I need something in return."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1525.0,"y":-675.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId